## Overall Progression Logic (why this order works)

```
Identity foundation (1-2) → Resilience (3) → Cloud extension (4-5)
→ Cloud identity (6-7) → Cloud compute (8) → SaaS migration (9-10)
→ Endpoint management (11) → Security wrap-up (12)
```

Each lab depends on the previous one being solid — don't skip ahead if a checklist item is failing, since problems compound (e.g. DNS misconfiguration in Lab 8 will look like a "domain join" problem, but the root cause is back in Lab 4-5's networking design).

## General tips across all labs
- **Snapshot your VMs before each lab** in VMware Workstation — if something breaks, revert rather than troubleshooting from scratch under time pressure.
- **Keep a running notes doc** of every IP, credential, and naming convention you use — real IT documentation habits start here.
- **Budget watch:** Labs 4-12 use real Azure/M365 resources. Use free trials, stop/deallocate VMs when not actively using them, and set a spending alert/budget cap in Azure to avoid surprise charges.
